# Krea 2 text-to-image (3DAIGC-API / DGX)

Read **`memory-bank/krea2-text-to-image-ops.md`** when Krea, text-to-image, or `krea2_turbo_text_to_image` is mentioned.

## Agent must execute (not delegate)

On Krea setup, load failure, or job error:

1. `grep` / `tail logs/scheduler.log` for worker load vs inference traceback
2. `./venv/bin/python -c "from diffusers import Krea2Pipeline; print('OK')"` — if fail: `bash scripts/setup_krea2.sh --deps-only`
3. `bash scripts/restart_services.sh` after setup or `adapters/krea2_adapter.py` changes
4. Verify weights: `test -d pretrained/krea/Krea-2-Turbo`
5. Smoke: `curl` POST text-to-image with 512² before declaring fixed

**Do not** reply with "run this script" — execute it (`agent-run-instructions.mdc`).

## Invariants (do not revert)

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Setup script | `scripts/setup_krea2.sh` (diffusers git pin) |
| Weights | `pretrained/krea/Krea-2-Turbo` |
| Adapter | `adapters/krea2_adapter.py` — `rope_parameters` → `rope_scaling`; Qwen3-VL tokenizer from hub |
| Post-pip | `bash scripts/post_pip_guard.sh` after any venv pip change |

Operator table: OpenNexus `docs/scripts-cheatsheet.md` §7a.

## Regression gate

After Krea or venv changes: confirm Kimodo still listed in `/api/v1/system/models` and run `post_pip_guard.sh` — do not break other enabled models.
